WEBVTT

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.270
You fucking coward!

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.500
The Executioners aren't gonna ignore this!

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.740
Fuck, they're just lame tags?!

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:57.470
Why...

00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:59.410
Why doesn't this shit ever work?!

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:18.710
Irritation and impatience

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.670
are the anguishes of the weak.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.410
At the same time,

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.570
they still desire the right to either change themselves,

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:41.540
seek strength,

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:47.950
or abandon their weaknesses.

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:55.420
In the meanwhile,

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:02.860
they seal themselves up

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.520
in the color of lies.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:45.150
Distractions day after day, it's always something

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:45.150
Meutsuri Shiteru Hibi Are Kore

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:49.290
and no one has even realized that

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:54.310
I see the crimson trailing down your cold skin

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:54.310
Awadatsu Hada wo Tsutai Ochiru CRIMSON

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:58.500
Why do you want another punishment?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:58.500
Why do you want Atarashii Batsu wo

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:03.250
The sweet fragrances that are drifting about

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:03.250
Tadayou Amai Kaori wo Tada

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.810
I just want to leave them be

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.810
Asobasete Itai Dake Nano sa

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:15.490
Someone hurry up and shoot me

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:15.490
Dareka Boku wo Hayaku Uchinuite yo

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:20.640
Show me a gunshot strong enough to make a hole

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:20.640
Show me Kantsuushita Juusou Ana ga Aku Hodo

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:25.110
I crush my thorny grip

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:25.110
Toge Darake no GRIP Nigiritsubushite

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:30.880
and load bullets that look like ripe flowerbuds

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:30.880
Osanai Mada Tsubomi no You na Dangan de

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:34.990
Let me shoot through the soul

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:34.990
Let me, shot through the soul

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:39.940
and dye it rose

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:39.940
Bara-iro ni Somare

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.850
There's so many of them.

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:04.740
I can't buy more time.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.660
The hyenas have arrived, eh?

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:17.620
Hey, the previous guest hasn't checked out yet.

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:21.740
There's nothing you'd want here, missy!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:27.210
Leave it to the big boys to pick up the tags!

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:38.340
If you're going to be a distraction, I'll play with you a bit.

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:01.750
Akira...!

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:03.500
Akira?!

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:07.520
Akira!

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:20.240
Erm, have this...

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:22.060
I don't need it.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:23.950
It'll heal by itself even if I leave it alone.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:29.220
Yet, it was you that protected me and got injured and all...

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:31.400
It's not a big deal.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:33.160
I didn't like them, anyway.

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:40.540
Sorry. This is probably all that I can do for you...

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:43.420
Akira!

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.020
Wait!

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:46.940
Akira!

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:54.630
Huh?

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:56.790
Akira?

00:05:57.470 --> 00:05:58.510
Akira?!

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:46.820
You bastard!

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:56.830
Aren't you a bit too optimistic about this?!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:04.370
Wasn't that a sorry excuse for a counter-attack?!

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.450
Why don't you let us have some fun?

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:11.970
Hey now, don't be so cold.

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:17.880
C'mon, why don't you try hurting him to make him understand what pain means?

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:20.330
Yeah, that's right...

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:26.350
I wonder how long you can keep up that smug face when you're in pain.

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:28.240
It's all just too exciting!

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:31.900
Would that happen to hurt, hun?

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:38.270
Want us to slice you up some more?!

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:43.280
Hey, yo.

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.840
Ey, what's the matter?!

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.220
What's the deal, hey?!

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:01.090
What the hell are you doing?!

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:02.220
Hey, you!

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.250
Get a hold of yourself, man!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.670
Just hold on, man!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.140
Hey!

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:34.360
Don't worry.

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:37.560
Go wait over there for just a bit.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.440
These are definitely them.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.700
Then I'll leave the rest to you as usual.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:01.930
What happened to the matter we had previously discussed?

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:04.850
Lately, there've been quite a few odds and ends that haven't been met.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.170
Nothing extraordinary has stood out, either.

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.070
As of right now, you'll have to keep on waiting a bit longer.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.140
Be sure to hurry with that.

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:20.260
Would there be something the matter with that magnum opus of mine?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.930
Every time I see him, I feel utterly disgusted.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:29.550
Well then, if you're finished here, please go back to whatever you were doing.

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:33.190
It just so happens to be about time for me to sleep with that child.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:36.340
Aren't you mistaking that with torture?

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.240
Good riddance.

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:48.580
He could just say if he'd like to unwind a little.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:56.280
But if all he wants to do is turn away, he can have it his way.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.460
He's still quite a strange man.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:20.160
I will never understand what strange people think.

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:21.900
Not one bit.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:15.320
His back hit the ground and there were also witnesses present at the fight, so...

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:40.970
Just dye in that color...

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:45.310
There's nothing but misery...

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.500
Hmm?

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.080
Something's there?

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.460
I wonder if it's a kitty!

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:17.100
Don't make a fuss!

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.500
They'll find us if you do.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:24.620
Here kitty, kitty, kitty~

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.450
Kitty, kitty!

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:29.970
Hmm, I was wrong!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:32.820
It's just the worn-down ol' man!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.120
I'm sorry that I'm so worn-down.

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:42.040
Kitty--!

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:43.700
The fuck--

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:46.460
What the fuck are you doin', you old fart?!

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.600
What are you doing over there?

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.620
Are you playing hide-and-seek?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.180
As if I'd play that game.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:54.460
I'm just taking an old man's walk around the block.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.650
If that's all you've got to say, scram already.

00:12:57.110 --> 00:13:00.240
But seeing you act so sneaky...

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.700
It makes me want to kill you, you know.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:09.230
Killing a lamer like me would be pretty boring, no?

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:12.810
Don't you guys like chasing after people who run away and cry when you go kill 'em?

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.560
That's right.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.820
That's definitely my favorite!

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:18.400
You guys are just beasts, huh?

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.750
Well then, hurry and go back to your master's dwelling now.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:32.260
Come to think of it, aren't you old men all the same age?

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:34.540
Why don't we all jus' get along, then?

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:37.940
You're so fucking noisy, you know.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:41.420
How many braincells do you wanna keep?

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.190
Shit, that hurt!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:49.500
You're carrying him back this time.

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:53.140
Fuckin' pain! What a shitty old man you are!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:56.180
You're always randomly hittin' my head like that!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.580
Can't you ever give it a rest?!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:01.200
I'll stain you in red if you--Hey!

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:15.840
Did I do that to him?

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:26.240
About that, you know...

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:30.220
That fucker was just like a worm creeping and crawling in the dirt. It was annoying as fuck.

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:41.900
Akira is... okay, right?

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:54.980
I'll go home together with Akira!

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:04.060
Really now.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:08.980
You really should move with more caution when the Executioners are around.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.870
Those guys will target and hunt you till your death...

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.660
No, they won't stop there. They'll chase you even after you die.

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:29.150
Why the hell are you here of all places?

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:30.360
Hm?

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.970
Well, I'm an information broker.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.150
I heard that Shiki appeared around these parts,

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:36.950
so I came by to spy in person.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.540
And you're alone too, no?

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.160
That's right.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.150
The other two should be at the hotel, right?

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:52.150
Let's hurry and meet up with them, then.

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:11.960
Rin!

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.030
I'm back!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:16.340
Huh?

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.450
Keisuke, you're by yourself?

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:20.720
Where's Akira?

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:22.890
Erm...

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:29.600
Akira!

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.040
You're right!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:33.910
Akira!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.320
Old man?

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.710
Why are you with him?

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:38.900
Is it that wrong to be tagging along?

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:42.120
All I did was find him and follow him over here.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:49.980
Akira...

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.450
You don't look well...

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.310
You're injured?!

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:55.750
He is.

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:57.200
We need to treat you immediately!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.050
Calm down, Keisuke!

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:01.120
It's not a wound worth fussing over.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:11.020
There we have the ointment, then the bandaging, and then--

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:30.990
Pass me an emergency kit and then some water!

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:50.070
Come on, hurry and go to him already.

00:17:58.170 --> 00:17:59.490
Does it hurt?

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:00.530
Not much at all.

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:08.430
Even if it's not hurting now, it might get aggravated.

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:09.870
Akira...

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.170
It's like you're exaggerating over nothing.

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:18.680
B-But, if we've got equipment to treat it, we may as well...

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:20.140
And...

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:30.600
Y-You've been acting so rough lately...

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.810
I can't help but feel a bit concerned...

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:42.950
Just leave me alone!

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:47.030
I can't do that!

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:50.160
You never seem to take care of yourself!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:56.940
Do you really understand what Igra is about?

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.310
Congratulations.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:22.230
You really are amazing, Akira.

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:26.910
Just quit with that already...!

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:29.930
I-I'm sorry!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.930
If you've got something to say, why don't you just say it clearly for once?!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:37.930
Eh?

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:42.800
I'm just glad that you're back safe and unharmed.

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:46.570
And well, without tags, we wouldn't be able to go home together.

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:50.410
That's not all. We wouldn't be able to live together anymore.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:53.890
Yet, it seems that you were able to get a tag already, unlike me...

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:59.850
Don't tell me that you don't know how you're supposed to get these tags...

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:05.610
Don't you want to ask how exactly I came back with this?!

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:12.640
Er, well, I'm relieved as long as you came back alive.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.860
You want to ask, don't you?!

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.980
Whether I actually killed my opponent or not?!

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:27.290
Can you really accept a murderer?! Or am I wrong?

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:29.860
Stop trying to distort that fact and laugh like that!

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.630
That's not what I intended...!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:36.140
I just thought that it was what you wanted, so I just...

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:39.800
It has nothing to do with whether I wanted this or not!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.830
What's the deal with you?!

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:51.440
You've always been the same ever since long ago.

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:53.110
You've never changed one bit!

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:54.380
You don't understand anything!

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:03.640
Did you really think that killing someone might actually be a lot of fun or something?

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:08.010
Are you actually thinking that I'd feel better if you make light of the situation?!

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:10.960
I-I'm so sorry!

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.470
E-Erm, Akira...!

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:15.110
Just cut the crap already!

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:19.530
I feel nothing but irritation when I look at you now.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.090
I'm sorry!

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:25.400
About that... I...!

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:30.160
I'm really sorry!

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:32.150
Wait--!

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:34.930
Keisuke!

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:25.570
We are all the way
through hurting down there

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:32.940
Doko no Zankyou ni Mimi wo Fusagu

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:32.940
These reverberations and echoes from somewhere fill my ears

00:22:34.620 --> 00:22:37.300
Wracking each other's hollows out

00:22:37.300 --> 00:22:44.880
Mou Tsureteku Kanjou wo Tomarezu ni

00:22:37.300 --> 00:22:44.880
These dragging feelings
haven't been stopped already

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:52.360
Doko Dekake Chigatta Torimodosenai Kyouri

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:52.360
My different, unrecoverable
feelings came out of nowhere

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:58.320
Kizutsukekoto Dashita Tsunagarenakatte ne

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:58.320
We couldn't connect
after your wounds surfaced

00:22:58.550 --> 00:23:03.940
Koukai mo Zankyou mo Todokanai

00:22:58.550 --> 00:23:03.940
Together with my regrets,
my echoes won't reach you

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:07.120
So once more again

00:23:07.120 --> 00:23:10.350
I dare you reply

00:23:10.540 --> 00:23:15.120
Kimi no Senaka mo Ima

00:23:10.540 --> 00:23:15.120
It's at your back

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:23.450
Kodoku na Yoru ga Tsurete Itte Shimau yo

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:23.450
that now carries along the
lonesome, isolated nights

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:26.380
I want to be with you

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:34.270
Mou Modorenai Basho ni Iru no

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:34.270
Are you really at a place
where I can't return to?

00:23:51.540 --> 00:23:53.210
We've got to clean up the trash again, today?

00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:56.340
Everyone's just doing whatever they want nowadays, huh?!

00:23:56.340 --> 00:23:57.550
Well, if that's the case,

00:23:57.550 --> 00:23:59.550
why don't we just clear out the trash?

00:24:00.690 --> 00:24:02.490
Right on, let's do it!

00:24:01.890 --> 00:24:04.510
Episode 6

00:24:02.490 --> 00:24:04.530
Let's get it on!
